  "title": "MainStreet Bancshares, Inc. Announces First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "Net Interest Margin Expands on Disciplined Funding Strategy FAIRFAX, Va., April 20, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - MainStreet Bancshares, Inc. (Nasdaq: MNSB MNSBP), the financial holding company for MainStreet Bank, reported a net income of $4.1 million for the quarter-ended March 31, 2026, resulting in earnings per common share of $0.48. The net interest margin expanded 9 basis points during the quarter to 3.47%, resulting from consistent loan pricing and lower funding costs. During the quarter",
